1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:02,838
Carbon content decides the variety.

2
00:00:02,838 --> 00:00:07,773
Cast iron, two and a half to four and a half percent, is hard but brittle.

3
00:00:07,773 --> 00:00:13,020
Wrought iron, below a quarter of a percent, is soft and weldable.

4
00:00:13,020 --> 00:00:16,536
In between, steel is both hard and tough.

